% Scenario: a form placement in the dump. A form executed twice lists
% one form resource with its box and content, and two placement lines
% with their matrices.
/F << /FormType 1 /BBox [0 0 20 10] /Matrix [1 0 0 1 0 0]
  /PaintProc { pop 0 0 moveto 20 10 lineto stroke } >> def
100 100 translate F execform
200 300 translate F execform
showpage
